<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tenaga named focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tenaga named focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Wednesday it had named Malaysia's Tenaga Nasional Bhd a global focus one stock.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept Tenaga's ratings of near-term buy and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
